ble strike\nWhenever one or more creature cards leave your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Cyan.","cardTypes":["Creature"],"colors":["W"],"colorIdentity":["W"],"keywords":["Double strike"],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/a/1/a1e779b4-32dd-406b-8b68-48f6df458005.jpg?1748704247","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/a/1/a1e779b4-32dd-406b-8b68-48f6df458005.jpg?1748704247","pngUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/png/front/a/1/a1e779b4-32dd-406b-8b68-48f6df458005.png?1748704247","power":"3","toughness":"3","isLegendary":true,"canBeCommander":true,"tags":["board_wipe","commander","cost_reducer","creature","graveyard_synergy","legendary"],"printedNames":[]},{"id":"05dd5c36-40a8-4776-9766-aa56bb1783ef","oracleId":"2c2ca6ae-9fd6-4bff-b9e2-801336c74c12","lang":"en","name":"Cyber Simulacrum // Cyber Simulacrum (cont'd)","manaValue":0.0,"typeLine":"Card // Card","oracleText":"2-6 Players | 1 Pack | 10 Minutes\nOBJECTIVE:\nSometimes technology is useful, and sometimes it's downright confusing! Deduce the identity of your cards using only images from the internet.\nGET READY:\nOpen a booster pack and remove all ad, token, and art cards. Deal one card face down to each player, setting the rest aside. Each player secretly looks at their card, then searches its card name using an internet search engine. Navigate to the first three image results that are not of a Magic card or Magic art, then choose one of those images. If you're unsure if something depicts Magic art, use your best judgment.\nLET'S PLAY:\nOnce each player has selected an image, place the chosen cards back in with the unchosen cards. Then shuffle all the cards and display them in a face-up grid. Randomly determine a player to reveal their found image first. The other players work together to guess which card in the grid matches that image. Once their final choice is made, the player who chose the image takes that card and places it in front of them. Play continues with the next player revealing their image until all guesses have been made.\nTO WIN:\nAfter all guesses have been made, each player reveals the correct match for their image. If every card was correctly matched, everyone wins!","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/0/5/05dd5c36-40a8-4776-9766-aa56bb1783ef.jpg?1664673107","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/0/5/05dd5c36-40a8-4776-9766-aa56bb1783ef.jpg?1664673107","pngUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/png/front/0/5/05dd5c36-40a8-4776-9766-aa56bb1783ef.png?1664673107","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":[],"printedNames":["Cyber Simulacrum","Cyber Simulacrum (cont'd)"]},{"id":"3420845c-bcb3-4969-9c21-bf4732babfe2","oracleId":"2088e791-9ce5-4e97-a4ce-f51adaa3f42b","lang":"en","name":"Cyclone Summoner","manaValue":7.0,"typeLine":"Creature — Giant Wizard","oracleText":"When this creature enters, if you cast it from your hand, return all permanents to their owners' hands except for Giants, Wizards, and lands.","cardTypes":["Creature"],"colors":["U"],"colorIdentity":["U"],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"legal","modern":"legal","historic":"legal","timeless":"legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"legal","brawl":"legal","legacy":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/4/3420845c-bcb3-4969-9c21-bf4732babfe2.jpg?1631055985","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/3/4/3420845c-bcb3-4